---
// ConvertibilityEvolutionTimeline.astro
---

<div class="my-12 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  
  <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-1">Illustration 3</div>
    <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium m-0">India's Evolution of Convertibility</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="p-8">
    <div class="relative border-l-2 border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800/60 ml-4 space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Stage 1 -->
      <div class="relative pl-6">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-slate-300 dark:bg-slate-700 border-2 border-slate-50 dark:border-navy-900"></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">Pre-1991</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Foreign-exchange scarcity & FERA controls</div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Stage 2 -->
      <div class="relative pl-6">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-rose-400 dark:bg-rose-600 border-2 border-slate-50 dark:border-navy-900 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(244,63,94,0.4)]"></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">1991</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400">Balance-of-payments crisis</div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Stage 3 -->
      <div class="relative pl-6">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 dark:bg-indigo-600 border-2 border-slate-50 dark:border-navy-900"></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">1994</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Current-account convertibility</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 4 -->
      <div class="relative pl-6">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-slate-300 dark:bg-slate-700 border-2 border-slate-50 dark:border-navy-900"></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">Late 1990s</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Capital-account reform debate & FEMA</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 5 -->
      <div class="relative pl-6">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-500 border-2 border-slate-50 dark:border-navy-900 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.4)]"></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">2012</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">NRO → NRE facility established</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 6 -->
      <div class="relative pl-6">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-500 border-2 border-slate-50 dark:border-navy-900"></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">2026</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">New tax-reporting architecture (Forms 145/146)</div>
      </div>

    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 italic">
      The important pattern is not "control became freedom." It is: <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 not-italic font-semibold">control became managed freedom.</strong>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
